data: {"id": "55fef972ab29469b-thinking-parallel_evidence-1253", "run_id": "55fef972ab29469b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 采集事实\n\n**Kubernetes Pod 状态 (kubectl_get_yaml + kubectl_describe)**\n- Pod `workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` 在 `aiops-case-02` 命名空间，运行在 `node2`\n- 容器 `app`：`Image: registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`, `ImagePullPolicy: Always`\n- `imagePullSecrets: <absent>` — 无镜像拉取密钥\n- 阶段：`Pending`，容器状态 `Waiting`，`Reason: ImagePullBackOff`\n- 无初始化错误，无 previous 容器\n\n**Events (kubectl_events + kubectl get events)**\n- 101s: `Failed to pull image`: `lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host`\n- 101s: `Error:", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788764828026, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

